---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const inputCls = 'border-0 border-b border-black/40 bg-transparent py-2 text-base focus:outline-none focus:border-accent';

const steps = [
  { n: 'Step 1 :', t: 'Fill out the task request form' },
  { n: 'Step 2 :', t: 'Wait for 126Verse to confirm the request' },
  { n: 'Step 3 :', t: 'Get work results' },
];
---

<Base title="Work order | 126Verse" lang="en" alt="/vi/contact/urgent" hideFooterCta>
  <section class="px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-12">
    <h1 class="word-line"><span class="word-up display text-[clamp(2.5rem,8vw,8rem)]" style="animation-delay:0.2s">Urgent Task</span></h1>
    <p class="fu font-semibold text-[clamp(1.2rem,2.6vw,2rem)] leading-snug max-w-4xl mt-8" style="animation-delay:0.45s">Time's ticking! Designing a key visual, poster, or banner for our upcoming advertising campaign - we've got just 48 hours. Let's make every second count!</p>
  </section>

  <section class="px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 py-12 hairline">
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      {steps.map((s) => (
        <div data-reveal>
          <p class="label text-accent">{s.n}</p>
          <p class="label mt-3">{s.t}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="label opacity-50 mt-10" data-reveal>(For POSM products, Social posts we can complete within 48 working hours at the earliest)</p>
  </section>

  <section class="px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 py-12 hairline-soft grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10" data-reveal>
    <p class="label opacity-80" style="white-space:pre-line">- The cost of maintaining your internal design team is too large compared to work efficiency.

- You urgently need high-quality design products for advertising campaigns such as POSM, Social media, and products related to brand image.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
      <p class="label opacity-80">We serve even the smallest customers with the hope of walking together in the early stages of development.</p>
      <p class="label opacity-80">Backed by our experienced team, 126verse can seamlessly integrate as an extension of your internal team, proficiently managing all design-related tasks.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 py-12 hairline-soft" data-reveal>
    <h2 class="display text-2xl md:text-3xl">Consolidation - Maximum efficiency !</h2>
    <p class="label opacity-80 mt-6 max-w-3xl" style="white-space:pre-line">- Maximize efficiency while minimizing costs! Maintaining an in-house design team can strain resources.

- Your business is always passive when it needs high-quality design products for advertising campaigns such as POSM, Social media, and products related to brand image.</p>
    <p class="label opacity-80 mt-6 max-w-3xl" style="white-space:pre-line">Let's forge a partnership where we seamlessly integrate into your team, enhancing work efficiency and delivering long-term benefits.

Check out 126Verse's work on images for campaigns by:</p>
    <div class="mt-5 flex gap-8">
      <a href="/work/yamaha-music" class="cta-link label">Yamaha Music</a>
      <a href="/work/daesang" class="cta-link label">Daesang</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-5 sm:px-8 md:px-12 py-16 hairline">
    <form name="Task request" method="POST" action="#" class="max-w-2xl flex flex-col gap-7" data-reveal>
      <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <span class="label">Name <em class="not-italic text-accent">*</em></span>
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Enter your name" required class={inputCls} />
      </label>
      <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <span class="label">Email <em class="not-italic text-accent">*</em></span>
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email Address" required class={inputCls} />
      </label>
      <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <span class="label">How did you hear of us?</span>
        <input type="text" name="source" placeholder="Enter your answer" class={inputCls} />
      </label>
      <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <span class="label">What design product do you need? <em class="not-italic text-accent">*</em></span>
        <select name="product" required class={inputCls}>
          <option value="">Select one</option>
          <option>Banner</option>
          <option>Leaflet</option>
          <option>brochure</option>
          <option>Standee</option>
          <option>Video ads</option>
          <option>Gif ads</option>
          <option>Social post</option>
          <option>Sản phẩm khác</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <span class="label">Design request description <em class="not-italic text-accent">*</em></span>
        <span class="label opacity-50">The message you want to convey, the main color, the style you aim for... the more requests the product will have, the more it will be right for you!</span>
        <textarea name="description" rows="5" placeholder="Your message here" required class="border border-black/40 bg-transparent p-3 text-base focus:outline-none focus:border-accent"></textarea>
      </label>
      <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <span class="label">Attachment File <em class="not-italic text-accent">*</em></span>
        <span class="label opacity-50">Compatible designs you want to aim for, logos, fonts... we use everything you send!</span>
        <input type="file" name="file" required class="label" />
      </label>
      <label class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <span class="label">When do you want to receive your first results? <em class="not-italic text-accent">*</em></span>
        <span class="label opacity-50" style="white-space:pre-line">After confirming your request, we can send you the results as soon as possible after 48 working hours.
Don't worry we check and respond to emails all the time!</span>
        <input type="text" name="deadline" placeholder="Enter your answer" required class={inputCls} />
      </label>
      <label class="flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer">
        <input type="checkbox" name="confirm" required class="w-4 h-4 accent-[#5E0ED7]" />
        <span class="label">I agree to the Privacy Policy.</span>
      </label>
      <button type="submit" class="self-start bg-ink text-white label !text-[13px] px-12 py-4 border-0 cursor-pointer hover:bg-accent transition-colors">Send</button>
    </form>

    <p class="label opacity-60 mt-14 max-w-3xl" style="white-space:pre-line" data-reveal>- Payment costs will be sent in the task confirmation email.

- Partners need to pay 30%-50% in advance depending on job requirements. The remainder will be paid upon completion of the work.

- Design modifications and adjustments will be charged after the first correction. We hope our partners will share clearly what you need to get a satisfactory product the first or second time.

- Current payment method: Bank transfer, Paypal.
For other payment cases, please contact us. We can help you in other ways!</p>
  </section>
</Base>
